{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Evaluate supplied Rulebook rules and facts; save an immutable account-owned decision. yes means the supplied rules allow, no means they block, review needs human review. Use decide_prepaid_get_record for its summary and decide_prepaid_export_record for signed evidence. Require approved policy and trusted facts. One paid unit per completed record; identical operation_id/input retries add no debit. Pending has no record: read or retry unchanged. Changed input under the same ID is OPERATION_CONFLICT; never replace IDs to clear pending work. Requires owner-approved scoped access. Export before 90-day expiry; on RECORD_EXPIRED stop, never change IDs to bypass it. On HTTP 429 stop automatic retries and honor Retry-After; without it, ask the owner to inspect the lifetime limit. No result grants external-action authority. No credit purchases, limit changes or execution.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"condition":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"all":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/condition"},"maxItems":32,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["all"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"any":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/condition"},"maxItems":32,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["any"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"not":{"$ref":"#/$defs/condition"}},"required":["not"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,159}$","type":"string"},"operator":{"enum":["exists","not_exists","eq","neq","gt","gte","lt","lte","in","not_in","contains","not_contains"],"type":"string"},"value":true},"required":["field","operator"],"type":"object"}]},"input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"properties":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"enum":["array","object","number","integer",